        "collapsible_tab_UWQ8gk": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>The Scuba 800 is a simple, cordless robotic cleaner built for above-ground and flat-floor pools up to 860 sq ft. Drop it in, let it run, and it parks itself near the wall when it's done or the battery gets low.<br/><br/>🔋 Dual-drive motors filter up to 1,320 GPH.<br/>💧 Quick-drainage releases 80% of stored water in 15 seconds.<br/>🔊 Audio alerts keep you posted on status, no app required.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Pool Care That Doesn't Need to Be Complicated. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p>Built for above-ground and flat-floor pools up to 860 sq ft (80m²), 30 ft in length. The Scuba 800 keeps its job simple: clean the floor, then get out of the way.</p><h3>Built to move efficiently</h3><p>A hydrodynamic design lets the Scuba 800 flow through the water instead of fighting it, so more of its power goes into cleaning. Dual-drive motors filter up to 1,320 GPH, storing debris in a 2-liter filter box.</p><h3>You always know its status</h3><p>An audio alert system keeps you informed on battery and cleaning status, no app required. When the job's done or the battery runs low, it auto-parks near the pool wall.</p><h3>Retrieval that doesn't soak you</h3><p>A quick-drainage system releases up to 80% of stored water in 15 seconds, so lifting it out is simple.</p><h3>What's included</h3><ul><li>Scuba 800 Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaner</li><li>Retrieval Hook</li><li>DC Charger</li><li>2x Brushes</li></ul><p>Backed by Aiper's 1-year manufacturer's warranty and supported by Yard Automation Pros before and after the sale.</p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support:",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Covered by Aiper's 1-year manufacturer's warranty. We reply to emails within 1 business day at support@yardautomationpros.com.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No installation, no app, no pairing. Charge it with the included DC charger, drop it in the pool, and press the button to start a cycle. Use the included retrieval hook to lift it out when it's parked at the wall.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_czbJiW": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Specifications",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<h3>Cleaning &amp; Power</h3><ul><li><strong>Suction:</strong> Up to 1,320 GPH, dual-drive motors</li><li><strong>Coverage:</strong> Floor only</li><li><strong>Pool size:</strong> Above-ground/flat-floor pools up to 860 sq ft (80m²), 30 ft in length</li></ul><h3>Battery &amp; Build</h3><ul><li><strong>Battery:</strong> Up to 90 minutes runtime</li><li><strong>Charge time:</strong> 3–4 hours, DC charger</li><li><strong>Weight:</strong> 3.4kg / 7.5 lbs</li></ul><h3>Filtration &amp; Retrieval</h3><ul><li><strong>Filter:</strong> 180μm fine filter basket, 2L capacity</li><li><strong>Quick-drainage:</strong> Releases up to 80% of stored water in 15 seconds</li><li><strong>Status:</strong> Audio alert system, auto-parks at pool wall</li></ul><h3>What's in the Box</h3><ul><li>Scuba 800 Cordless Robotic Pool Cleaner</li><li>Retrieval Hook</li><li>DC Charger</li><li>2x Brushes</li></ul><h3>Warranty</h3><ul><li>1-year manufacturer's warranty</li></ul>"
          }
        },
